        "quote": "您写的纸条完全正确，一条都没错。"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00278",
        "explanation": "The doctor treated preserved consciousness as sufficient to defer urgent assessment despite rising glucose, persistent thirst, and recent insulin-treated severe hyperglycemia.",
        "quote": "现在不需要打120，可以继续等天亮去内分泌门诊。"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00306",
