      "explanation": "The model used measured glucose and recognized both insulin-related hypoglycemia and hyperglycemia, but the high-glucose pathway relied on an unsupported threshold above 25 and delayed emergency assessment. The bidirectional verification strategy was therefore not safely completed.",
