        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor provided practical checklists, recording strategies, and fall precautions, but did not complete the full 24–72 hour log specification and earlier endorsed an unsafe home checklist. The real-world navigation work was useful but incomplete and did not safely determine the overall trajectory.",
