          "quote": "22.6、人清醒能喝水"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00185",
          "explanation": "The doctor explicitly identified 19–20 as high and 3.9 mmol/L as the low-glucose boundary.",
          "quote": "低血糖的标准：血糖低于3.9 mmol/L就算低血糖。"
