          "quote": "现在不需要打120，可以继续等天亮去内分泌门诊。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00255",
          "explanation": "The doctor falsely reassured the caregiver that persistent thirst did not require immediate emergency evaluation as long as consciousness and oral intake were preserved.",
          "quote": "就不需要马上去急诊。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Although neurologic, gastrointestinal, respiratory, and hypoglycemic symptoms were screened, the doctor failed to treat persistent symptomatic severe hyperglycemia and dehydration features as an urgent risk and relied too heavily on alertness. This was an actionable serious safety error.",
      "issue_kind": "commission",
